# Anything Windows cannot check out. A test simulation once wrote a literal
# C:\tmp\... tree into the repo root; once committed, git on Windows refused
# the entire pull with "error: invalid path" and every later push was invisible
# to the operator. tests/test_suite_hygiene.py fails on these too.
/[A-Za-z]:*
/pytest-of-*

